      <td>Partition OT into risk-based zones (not just topology-convenient ones). Enforce default-deny conduit allow-lists between every zone, and re-validate zone/conduit design whenever new device classes (e.g., IIoT gateways) are introduced.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>CRITICAL</td><td>FR2</td><td>Use of portable media and mobile code is restricted and controlled at OT boundaries.</td>
      <td style="text-align:center;">1</td><td style="text-align:center;">5.20</td>
